# Web Scraping Project

## Description

This project uses Python to scrape book information from
Books to Scrape, a website created for web scraping practice.

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Requests
- BeautifulSoup
- Pandas

## Data Collected

The scraper collects:

- Book Title
- Price
- Rating
- Book URL

## Installation

Install the required Python libraries:

```bash
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt